context-tools-optimize = Preview ranked context under a local token budget
context-tools-compact = Preview an evidence-linked local continuation ledger
context-tools-apply = Apply the reviewed context packet; nothing sent
context-tools-cancel = Cancel the context preview; nothing changed
context-tools-clear = Clear the applied local context packet
context-tools-receipts = Inspect retained outgoing request receipts
context-tools-search = Search retained tool output
context-tools-locations = Inspect retained failure locations
context-tools-cache-retry = Retry only the failed local cache operation
context-tools-cache-discard = Discard the failed local cache operation
context-tools-cache-purge = Purge the local revision and token cache
tool-plan-title = Reviewed tool plan
tool-plan-small = Enlarge to 60×18 to review or schedule nodes. Escape closes; nothing starts.
tool-plan-policy = Only bounded owned reads overlap (max 3). Every command has UNKNOWN effects, runs serially and needs its own exact one-shot review. A batch is not consent.
tool-plan-recovery = Resume includes failed/unstarted safe nodes only. Confirmed commands never repeat; lost mutation responses block until durable reconciliation. Restart only restores inspection. No exactly-once guarantee.
tool-plan-controls = e Author JSON · s Start · r Resume · b Serial comparison · h History · c Cancel queue · j Reconcile · ↑↓ Scroll · Esc Close
tool-plan-review-controls = Neutral review · scroll through all scope · y Schedule only · n/Esc Keep without execution
tool-plan-editor = Enter stages this exact JSON locally; Escape cancels. Paste accepted up to 64 KiB. No provider, execution or permission.
tool-plan-empty = No plan. Press e to author bounded JSON using title and nodes. Each node has id, dependencies, operation and reason. The literal example below is data, not authority.
tool-plan-action = Inspect or author a typed local tool plan
tool-plan-start-action = Preview starting the exact staged plan
tool-plan-resume-action = Preview safely resuming failed/unstarted nodes
tool-plan-cancel-action = Cancel plan admission and queued nodes
tool-plan-reconcile-action = Reconcile unknown outcomes with durable run evidence
tool-plan-history-controls = Retained history: inspection only · [ previous · ] next · h current plan · no start/resume authority
tool-plan-history-action = Inspect retained tool plan history without execution authority
tool-plan-serial-action = Preview an actual serial comparison of completed read-only calls
